  Description: 'Reliquary - intensity 4 of Shatterplane: eight plates braced by super-shielded ribs on
    every sixth line with danger rims, every other one half behind a super-shielded grille,
    four crystals. 4588 prisms, all neutral (3232 breakable, 1356 super-shielded, 704
    danger). Membrane radius 1200, spawn ring 780, the standard nucleus resized to 470 u by
    the controller (the ring blast is as wide as the nucleus; play geometry, not a claim),
    the crystal field laid by the controller on the plates'' axes. No flora; live elemental
    fauna (the Blob tadpole and shark, each creature rolling one of four elements, at 2x
    their authored populations). Authored by Tools/Build/author_shatterplane_assets.py -
    re-run it rather than hand-editing.'
